MODULE IRAM512

IMPORT RAM512
IMPORT MUX
IMPORT COUNTER
IMPORT REGISTER1BIT

INPUT IN[16]
INPUT LOAD
INPUT RESET
INPUT ADDR[9]
INPUT POWER

CLOCK CLK

LOW ZERO
HIGH ONE

OUTPUT OUT[16]
OUTPUT ROUT

WIRE ZERO16[16]
WIRE COUNTEROUT[16]
OUTPUT COMPARATOROUT

SPLIT ADDR A0 A1 A2 A3 A4 A5 A6 A7 A8

JOIN ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO16

COUNTER C1 ZERO16 ZERO POWER ONE CLK COUNTEROUT
SPLIT COUNTEROUT K0 K1 K2 K3 K4 K5 K6 K7 K8 K9 KA KB KC KD KE KF

AND G1 KD ONE TEMP1
AND G2 KE ONE TEMP2
AND G3 KF ONE TEMP3
AND G4 TEMP1 TEMP2 TEMP4
AND G5 TEMP3 TEMP4 COMPARATOROUT


REGISTER1BIT R2 COMPARATOROUT COMPARATOROUT POWER CLK ROUT

MUX M0 RESET ZERO ROUT MUXOUT
MUX M1 A0 KD MUXOUT S0
MUX M2 A1 KE MUXOUT S1
MUX M3 A2 KF MUXOUT S2

JOIN S0 S1 S2 A3 A4 A5 A6 A7 A8 ADDR

RAM512 R1 IN LOAD RESET ADDR CLK OUT
